                                          4532  #   -- -- -- | -- -- --
                                          4533  #    ^  ^  ^    ^  ^  ^
                                          4534  #    |  |  |    |  |  `--- Carry of unsigned L + signed R: SC = RX + UC
                                          4535  #    |  |  |    |  `----- Carry of unsigned L + unsigned R: UC = C7 ? L7&R7 : L7|R7
                                          4536  #    |  |  |    `------- Sign extension of signed R
                                          4537  #    |  |  `--------- MSB of unextended L + R
